ank you!!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/J1KUyrW", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@star_ium/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b959d34d/uploads/origins/9c0b0468-0439-4b8b-9f27-a5425bdefd1f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a48f4378705f486ef131607e44cb9cb0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b959d34d/uploads/origins/9c0b0468-0439-4b8b-9f27-a5425bdefd1f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a48f4378705f486ef131607e44cb9cb0, https://si.imgix.net/b959d34d/uploads/origins/9c0b0468-0439-4b8b-9f27-a5425bdefd1f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=552164b75d8df09c6596bec69c0cd7bf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b959d34d/uploads/origins/9c0b0468-0439-4b8b-9f27-a5425bdefd1f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d9fc3fb8a64063bb9892019ee79caee1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi Dr. Niumu, nice to meet you. I'm Ayane Aya, a Vtuber active on bilibili. I came to know about Niumu-sensei through my friend Rutis-chan's recommendation, and I fell in love with her wonderful illustrations, so I decided to request her! If you don't mind, could you draw my Vtuber character? I'm a little screwed up and quiet girl who lives on the planet 612 with a potato dog. I'd like to leave the composition, pose, etc. to you.  The use is mainly for distribution, video, SNS, etc. I do not do commercial use. I'll credit you when I use it! I'd be happy if you accept. Thank you very much!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/f9KehiU", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@star_ium/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/354e3a5c/uploads/origins/bd85fd2b-281e-4794-8572-74660ebddbeb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e4b4595a1a16b4ee861ab48e964b1fd0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/354e3a5c/uploads/origins/bd85fd2b-281e-4794-8572-74660ebddbeb?bg=%23fff&auto=