ur use of colors, your sense of drawing inorganic objects, and above all, your expression of flowers.\nI would be very happy if you could add some flowers to it.\nI'll leave it to you to give the clothes and atmosphere a modern or fantasy feel.\nI would be very happy if you could draw the feeling that you like.\n\nThis character is used in TRPG, PBW, and SNS, and I would like to use her there if she is accepted.\nIt would be great if you could get Umu-sama's signature on the illustration!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/SHKinpow/status/1272038551337631745", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@star_ium/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f6fd8115/uploads/origins/0aaae867-5e27-4864-93b3-a0d86459ef16?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75f4a6fa613319292ea9043a68d17da3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f6fd8115/uploads/origins/0aaae867-5e27-4864-93b3-a0d86459ef16?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75f4a6fa613319292ea9043a68d17da3, https://si.imgix.net/f6fd8115/uploads/origins/0aaae867-5e27-4864-93b3-a0d86459ef16?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d7fae9bb2efad7fb118dec57d7bca81 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f6fd8115/uploads/origins/0aaae867-5e27-4864-93b3-a0d86459ef16?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=378016e126021b4d7a8d6c5a0e79cd8b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi I love your style I was wondering if you could draw my vtuber oc, referenced here https://ibb.co/qxSCcNm in a pose like in this reference https://ibb.co/Wv99vj2 sorry for the short brief I don't know what else to add.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@star_ium/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6e57fd16/uploads/origins/f49dcfbb-25e3-4f6b-b34b-da6cfdf89b42?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d7e00456402c4d9d60189d0492d9b4a0", "thumbnail_src