t one of my NPCs in your style! If it's okay I'd like to show your work off on stream during breaks!\n\nMy character is a short alchemist from a misty city! They're part bird and part crocodile.\n\nThank you for your work!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/U8CXgeA", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@star_ium/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9d5add8a/uploads/origins/ad4287d2-d073-4563-abf6-2685ce3b3505?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed78aba0bb7d563bc92009bd57f126e6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9d5add8a/uploads/origins/ad4287d2-d073-4563-abf6-2685ce3b3505?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed78aba0bb7d563bc92009bd57f126e6, https://si.imgix.net/9d5add8a/uploads/origins/ad4287d2-d073-4563-abf6-2685ce3b3505?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c4a8dae1f8c245daa802e43c7bf2105 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9d5add8a/uploads/origins/ad4287d2-d073-4563-abf6-2685ce3b3505?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f2f82d1c73c92324c2601ec2532996f5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "It's nice to meet you, and I'd like to make a request.\n\nI'd like to see my favorite character, Brunnhilde (FGO), in the creator's design.\nI will leave all the facial expressions and composition to the creator.\nMy hope is to have a stylish and good-looking illustration.\nThe aspect ratio of the work is 16:9, and the delivery format is PSD or PNG, please.\nPlease cancel your order if the creator is accepting only original work because it is a secondary work.\n\nThank you very much for your consideration.\n\nhttps://www.wicurio.com/grand_order/index.php?plugin=ref&page=%E3%83%96%E3%83%AA%E3%83%A5%E3%83%B3%E3%83%92%E3%83%AB%E3%83%87&src=08801.jpg", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}